sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServe as KServe Router<br/>Platform-managed
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS Enforcement
    participant TGIS as vllm_tgis_adapter<br/>gRPC :8033
    participant VLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>HTTP :8000
    participant Spyre as IBM Spyre SDK<br/>Hardware Accelerator
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>S3 / PVC

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Loading (Startup)
    VLLM->>Storage: Load model weights<br/>HTTPS/NFS, TLS 1.2+
    Storage-->>VLLM: Model artifacts
    VLLM->>Spyre: Initialize accelerator<br/>Kernel/driver interface
    Spyre-->>VLLM: Accelerator ready

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: gRPC Inference (TGIS Protocol)
    Client->>KServe: Inference request<br/>gRPC
    KServe->>Istio: Route to pod<br/>Platform auth
    Istio->>TGIS: Forward request<br/>gRPC :8033, mTLS
    TGIS->>VLLM: Translate to vLLM call
    VLLM->>Spyre: Accelerated inference
    Spyre-->>VLLM: Generated tokens
    VLLM-->>TGIS: Inference result
    TGIS-->>Istio: gRPC response
    Istio-->>KServe: Response
    KServe-->>Client: Inference result

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: HTTP Inference (OpenAI API)
    Client->>KServe: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP
    KServe->>Istio: Route to pod<br/>Platform auth
    Istio->>VLLM: Forward request<br/>HTTP :8000, mTLS
    VLLM->>Spyre: Accelerated inference
    Spyre-->>VLLM: Generated tokens
    VLLM-->>Istio: JSON response
    Istio-->>KServe: Response
    KServe-->>Client: JSON result
